                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This one felt cheap. \r\nDoesn't help that the display settings are also broken, so the game changes the resolution of your monitor each time you start it.\r\n\r\nI finished the timed mode once and even though the stages had different requirements, the core gameplay remained basically the same: hope that nothing essential gets a cage. All the random spawning negative effects destroyed any strategy this game might have had.\r\n\r\nMaybe the other modes are better, but I don't want to waste any more time on this.",
